{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_43_1","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_43","textTraditional":"閏考","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_43_2","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_43","textTraditional":"月度不足，是生朔虛；天行有餘，是為氣盈。盈虛相懸，歲月乃牉。積牉而差，寒暑互易，百穀不成，庶政不明。聖人驗以斗柄，準以歲星，爰立閏法，信治百官。是故閏正而月正，月正而歲正。歲月既正，頒令考績，無有不時。國史正歲年以敘事，莫重於此。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_43_3","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_43","textTraditional":"遼始徵曆梁、唐。入晉之後，奄有帝制，乙未、大明，曆法再變。穆宗應曆六年，周用顯德欽天曆；十年，宋用建隆應天曆。景宗乾亨四年，宋用乾元曆。聖宗統和十九年，宋用儀天曆；太平元年，宋用崇天曆。道宗清寧十年，宋用明天曆；大康元年，宋用奉元曆；大安七年，宋用觀天曆。天祚皇帝乾統六年，宋用紀元曆。五代曆三變，宋凡八變，遼終始再變。曆法不齊，故定朔置閏，時有不同，覽者惑焉。作閏考。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_43_4","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_43","textTraditional":"十一","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_43_5","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_43","textTraditional":"十二","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_43_6","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_43","textTraditional":"首缺五閏","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_43_7","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_43","textTraditional":"太祖神冊五年","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_43_8","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_43","textTraditional":"耶律儼","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_43_9","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_43","textTraditional":"陳大任","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_43_10","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_43","textTraditional":"天贊二年","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_43_11","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_43","textTraditional":"梁閏","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_43_12","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_43","textTraditional":"缺一閏","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_43_13","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_43","textTraditional":"太宗天顯三年","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_43_14","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_43","textTraditional":"六年","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_43_15","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_43","textTraditional":"九年","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_43_16","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_43","textTraditional":"大任","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work